==Battleground==
*15 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*5 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*5 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*5 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**8 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Not a terribly difficult stage, so your strategy should revolve around completing it quickly. Low investment Worker Start Level Up [[Cat Combo|Combos]] such as [[Itchy Riches (Combo)|Itchy Riches]] and [[Don't Mess With Me! (Combo)|Don't Mess With Me!]] are ideal, and one should take full advantage of the high potential money gain from the early Croconator spam to accelerate any given strategy. Because all Metals are at low magnification, there is little to gain from bringing dedicated critters. Instead, bring your general meatshield combo and relevant spammable area attackers, such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N102 (Rare Cat)|Catarzan]]; if desired, a [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] variant can help to clean metals more quickly at little cost.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Power Saw Cat/Neo Saw Cat]]: Even at low investment, Miter Saw Cat is perfect for this stage, as his Alien Target makes him both a supremely powerful tank and dps unit against the stage's boss, and his high attack rate will also rip through the low magnification Metal enemies in seconds. In his [[True Form]], at levels 40+, each instance becomes essentially a permanent fixture of the battlefield as long as he is protected from the Wild Doges with proper meatshielding.

